WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A face feels familiar before its parts are counted.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Turn the entire portrait upside down.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Turn its eyes and mouth inside that frame.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The alteration may become harder to judge.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Change the reference frame. Test another explanation.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A perceptual illusion is not evidence for a product's claims.
